stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OPEN: transfer not auto-matched\n(NO_MATCH, UNDERPAID, OVERPAID, LATE,\nDUPLICATE_TRANSFER, MEMBER_CLAIM)
  OPEN --> WAITING_MEMBER: manager contacted member\n(contact logged)
  OPEN --> MATCHED: mapped to invoice,\namount equal → invoice PAID
  OPEN --> WAITING_TOPUP: mapped, amount less\n→ top-up QR sent
  WAITING_TOPUP --> MATCHED: member paid the rest\nbefore deadline
  WAITING_TOPUP --> REFUND_PENDING: deadline passed
  WAITING_MEMBER --> REFUND_PENDING: member wants refund\n(extra / duplicate)
  WAITING_MEMBER --> MATCHED: member keeps money\nfor a renewal invoice
  OPEN --> REJECTED: claim rejected with reason\n(no matching transaction)
  OPEN --> IGNORED: test / junk only,\nnote required
  REFUND_PENDING --> REFUNDED: bank reference entered
  MATCHED --> [*]
  REFUNDED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  IGNORED --> [*]
